  metin: "Kap\u0131c\u0131 Efendi,\n\nGece \xE7\xF6pleri kat kat topla. Merdivenler
    hep ayn\u0131d\u0131r, al\u0131\u015F\u0131rs\u0131n.\n\nBir \u015Fey yanl\u0131\u015Fsa
    \u2014 ne oldu\u011Funu sorma \u2014 KATA G\u0130RME, geri d\xF6n.\n\nSabah \xE7at\u0131n\u0131n
    kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kilitlemeyi unutma.\n\n\u2014 Y\xF6netim"
